  "title": "Sweet and Sour Meatballs (Suan T&#39;ien Niu Jou Po Lo La Tzu)",
  "description": "Beef meatballs, carrot, onion and pineapple pieces simmered in a pineapple sweet and sour sauce. Serve hot over steamed white rice.",
